// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2885557671" "All I see are a bunch of blobs and the arrow guys."
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1614801287" "We could take over this place.  The view is great from here."
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1099147694" "Wanna pounce a few pedestrians?"
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2325136754" "We should just waste this place and take the meteors."
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1030581100" "I feel like starting something."
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2669314373" "Yeah, nothing to see here.  For now."
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3573582479" "Send the guys through when you get a chance.  Let's mix it up."
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3570954452" "You look.  I use the walkie talkie.  It's called ranks, noob."

// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3954199406" "The time is right for terror!"
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2083038854" "Time to play!"
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P721307417" "Let's mix it up!"
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1306571735" "Finally!  Some action!"
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1012033621" "I spy with my little eye someone about to get beat!"
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P601559237" "Found some!  Let's play!"
// BLOODYBAY_ROOFTOPLOOKOUT_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1587143035" "Time to make this place earn it's name!"

// BLOODYBAY_STREETPATROL_GENERIC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P320395116" "This place is a wasteland."
// BLOODYBAY_STREETPATROL_GENERIC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4114316868" "Keep walking and we'll see what we see."
// BLOODYBAY_STREETPATROL_GENERIC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2824129239" "That's some wild meteor.  Let's head over and check it out later."
// BLOODYBAY_STREETPATROL_GENERIC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P196798836" "I love street sweeping.  Now who can I harass?"

// BLOODYBAY_STREETPATROL_GENERIC_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1032825788" "Let the games begin!"
// BLOODYBAY_STREETPATROL_GENERIC_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P615576826" "Time for some mayhem!"
// BLOODYBAY_STREETPATROL_GENERIC_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4100528845" "Let's do this!  Bloody Bay will earn its name today!"
// BLOODYBAY_STREETPATROL_GENERIC_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P868692042" "Time for some fun!"

// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1502072690" "Just rubble and some other stuff.  What am I looking for?"
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4165084486" "Hey, this would make a great addition to my art piece."
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3965706720" "Waste not.  Want not."
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P111306452" "Not much here.  You guys see anything worth having?"
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1557345068" "Sure, I'll tell them.  You guys need to head over there some more."

// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4224903855" "We don't share!"
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2060180671" "What's ours is ours and what's your is ours!  Let us help you unload!"
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1085065863" "Forget scavenging!  Let's help unload!"

// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4141309555" "Keep it up.  What we can't use, we can sell."
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1805310059" "Put your back into it.  I want to be the first to find anything important."
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4009702927" "We're not the only ones here.  We need to be faster and better."

// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_OBSERVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3752697495" "Mama never taught me to share!"
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_OBSERVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2063031217" "Let the fun begin!"
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_OBSERVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3175875744" "It's time to party!"
// BLOODYBAY_SCAVENGE_GENERIC_OBSERVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2643854521" "Time to demolish!"

// SHARKHEAD_HOTLOOT_HELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2592734644" "I'm gettin' a cut of this stuff, right?"
// SHARKHEAD_HOTLOOT_HELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2876308994" "Hurry up man! I've seen those Lost freaks work faster than you, and I don't think they even have opposable thumbs!"
// SHARKHEAD_HOTLOOT_HELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4043863126" "Yo, you think Dreck's gonna want any of this?"

// SHARKHEAD_HOTLOOT_LOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4087821034" "Back away. Finders keepers, losers get pounded."
// SHARKHEAD_HOTLOOT_LOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3430784504" "What, you got a problem or somethin'?"
// SHARKHEAD_HOTLOOT_LOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2563483934" "Back up, this stuff is mine!"

// SHARKHEAD_FREAKGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2112999068" "You ain't gettin' through here, punk!"
// SHARKHEAD_FREAKGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3849616834" "Back off, or you'll get dealt wit', Freakie-style."
// SHARKHEAD_FREAKGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1468830998" "Do I look like a chump to you? Back off!"

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_FSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P828346479" "Man, slow day today... I only robbed three stores so far."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_FSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2009865304" "I got called by Teh PwNxx0rz today, he wants me to help him out in Paragon... after insulting my momma, that is."

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_FSHOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2972728001" "You, interrupting me? What a joke."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_FSHOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1324150647" "If I'm gonna work for Teh PwNxx0rz, I better work you over first!"
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_FSHOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1662102264" "You got nuthin', fool!"

// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1920072774" "I hate guarding posts. I'd rather be kickin' someone's tail."
// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2767669953" "We gotta make sure no punks get by here."
// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P188785941" "Who's that over there? Did you see that?"

// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_CHOKEPOINT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P731371584" "Ain't nothin' but a punk lookin' to get robbed. Get 'em, boys!"
// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_CHOKEPOINT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1379381595" "Finally, some action! Bring it, buster!"
// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_CHOKEPOINT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P141565195" "Hahaha, look at this little squirt tryin' to be all tough... let's rough 'em up a bit!"
// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_CHOKEPOINT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P95296886" "Time to get Freaky Deaky!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1073067785" "Diggin' is one thing... but it'd be more fun with explosives."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2382016075" "Why do I gotta be shovelin' dirt on a miserable day like this?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1718659145" "Well, at least I didn't sign up for that Swiper or Smasher surgery... it'd make holding this shovel a real b--hey, what was that?"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3441890505" "Break time!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3866883997" "If you ain't gonna start diggin', then you better be ready to be buried!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P472115376" "Back off, we're workin' here!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3822648123" "You spilled my drink, jerk!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P69965068" "I thought I told you to never come here again!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P201857019" "I've had a bad day, but you're gonna have a worse one!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P746234441" "So...uh. You come here often?"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2755563919" "First I lose a drink, now I have a punk interrupting my fight? Sheesh!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2154846600" "If you ain't buyin', I'm sendin' you flyin'!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3946972269" "Worthless runt, get away from my drink!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1064020868" "Get back here you low-life punk!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2851385329" "You worthless trash, give me back my wallet!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2172471986" "Oooh, when I get my hand on you..."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3700345234" "You ain't gettin' my other wallet! Oops.."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2577530469" "You workin' with that trash?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4021257339" "You gotta be kiddin' me... another chump tryin' to gank me."

// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3088670922" "Man, hurry up... We ain't got all day to do this!"
// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3422551130" "You guys are slow! We've got Tanks that move faster than you!"
// SHARKHEAD_FREAK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P645070961" "Man, I get stuck runnin' the lines with you chumps... what's with that?"

// SHARKHEAD_FREAKRUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3558904696" "You hit like a wuss!"
// SHARKHEAD_FREAKRUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
