// SHARKHEAD_FREAKRUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3450620403" "Man, I've heard techno that hits harder than you do!"

// SHARKHEAD_FREAKRUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1783107623" "This is our fight, not yours!"
// SHARKHEAD_FREAKRUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1061996726" "Leave it to a wanna-be to ruin a perfectly good turf war."
// SHARKHEAD_FREAKRUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
