// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P568011942" "Forget buried treasure.  I'm gonna dig your burial plot!"
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1251503176" "See this hole?  It's gonna cover your remains, meat!"
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3053755839" "Come closer so I can use this shovel on you!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DRUNKENFIGHT_FIGHTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4095114300" "If you jusht shhtop meshhing with my firlgriend...none of thish would have happind..."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DRUNKENFIGHT_FIGHTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1277276039" "I may be out of it, but I can shhtill hurt you in a put locker!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DRUNKENFIGHT_FIGHTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1007161479" "Don't make me inshult your momma..."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DRUNKENFIGHT_FIGHTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4187159983" "Nish one.  I think you shplit my lip."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DRUNKENFIGHT_FIGHTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2368012857" "I love you, man...let'shhh beat 'em up inshtead..."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DRUNKENFIGHT_FIGHTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1069083621" "Shhho enough...we got bigger fishhh to fry."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DRUNKENFIGHT_FIGHTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3646004256" "What were we fighting about?  Who careshhh?  I see shomeone to hit."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_SNIPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4221582320" "Why hello little rabbit..."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_SCAVENGE_INSPECTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3006660631" "I have no idea how I am going to make money with this..."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_SCAVENGE_INSPECTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3554343605" "Huh...interesting.  And by interesting I mean absolutely worthless."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_SCAVENGE_INSPECTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2735395894" "Hm.  Interesting.  And by interesting I mean absolutely no market value.  What a waste of time."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_SCAVENGE_INSPECTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1966409198" "There is nothing here to sell.  I think we're digging in the wrong area."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_SCAVENGE_INSPECTING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3864286774" "I don't care if it's garbage!  It's mine and you can't have it!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_SCAVENGE_INSPECTING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1450965224" "Get your own garbage pile!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_SCAVENGE_INSPECTING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2415433688" "Oh you shoulda kept walking, you vulture!  Now you're in for a world of hurt!"

// STM_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P732800307" "So, let me get this straight.  If I make a mistake I lose my arm?"
// STM_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P578278880" "Look, I'm half parts.  I can't afford interruptions while I'm working."
// STM_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3151513720" "Shut it.  I'm working."

// STM_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3180108090" "Well, conspicuous we are not.  I'm just trying to let you know what's going on here."
// STM_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1462761534" "If you're going to make a mistake, let me know, so I can be far away when it happens."
// STM_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4269732677" "Okay, I'm not saying work faster?  I'm just saying don't go so slow."

// STM_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2769433101" "Bones, rubble, and body bags.  BORING."
// STM_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P117145046" "What am I supposed to do with THIS?"
// STM_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4057926251" "Useless. I can't sell this."
// STM_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P451111804" "If I can't weld it on or wear it, I don't need it."

// STM_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2010745122" "What's the purpose of YOUR life?  Just to be a pain?"

// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2463018764" "We should just torch the place."
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P895474891" "You know what I love about being Freakshow?  I never have to explain myself."
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2766176280" "What's our game plan for tonight?  Mischief and mayhem?"
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P120612270" "First we take out some stuff in Black Mariah.  Then we move on to The Flop.  What do you say?"

// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3250837831" "Pain lasts.  It's how you know you're alive.  Here, let me show you."
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2809128190" "He said, 'If you're gonna talk garbage, expect pain'.  So I hit him."
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P536697322" "Torture...slow...pain beyond belief!"
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1584540222" "Don't make us put some pain on you!"
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1137566644" "I can see you're no stranger to pain.  If not, let me introduce you."

// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3266145616" "Sounds good to me."
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P842687116" "Right with you."
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2275885021" "I hear you."
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P402397016" "Right on."
// STM_FREAK_BM_CHATTER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2150449024" "You bet."

// STM_FREAK_FLOP_BOOMBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P172843161" "Yeah!  That's what I'm talking about!  Turn it up!"
// STM_FREAK_FLOP_BOOMBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4272955803" "Crank it!"
// STM_FREAK_FLOP_BOOMBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1316254837" "Yeah!  Yeah!"

// STM_FREAK_FLOP_BOOMBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4044443182" "This here's a party and YOU'RE not invited!"
// STM_FREAK_FLOP_BOOMBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4251159021" "I don't see no invitation on you!  Crasher!"
// STM_FREAK_FLOP_BOOMBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P636698760" "Crasher!"

// STM_FREAK_FLOP_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P564311101" "Time to inflict some pain!"
// STM_FREAK_FLOP_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P623929454" "Oh we're gonna fight now...we're gonna fight...now..."
// STM_FREAK_FLOP_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3563612078" "Whee!  This is fun!"

// STM_FREAK_JP_CHATTER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2367690120" "I see a whole lot of opportunity.  Why are we not taking advantage of it?"
// STM_FREAK_JP_CHATTER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2138640086" "This is The Jackpot.  Of COURSE there's something going on.  Can I hurt someone yet?"

// STM_FREAK_JP_CHATTER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4166904569" "Life is pain!  Get used to it!"
// STM_FREAK_JP_CHATTER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P164190571" "I think I'm gonna punch ya."
// STM_FREAK_JP_CHATTER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P750636028" "Wanna knuckle sandwich?  Extra mayo?"

// STM_FREAK_JP_CHATTER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1664773120" "Right. Cheers. Thanksalot."

// STM_PLOT_LEADER_BM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P945270414" "So we'll get into the Giza by going down this corridor..."

// STM_PLOT_LEADER_BM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2035663557" "Messin' up my train of thought! Quit it!"
// STM_PLOT_LEADER_BM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P654093424" "Exterminate, exterminate!"
// STM_PLOT_LEADER_BM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P377780036" "I'll whomp on you for a bit, then get on with my plans. Got a problem with that?"

// STM_PLOT_LEADER_JP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3108923185" "What's the risk if we fail?  Pain heals and our chicks dig scars.  Let's go already!"
// STM_PLOT_LEADER_JP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2730810726" "It's a win-win situation.  If we fail, we create chaos.  If we succeed, we create chaos.  I'm not seeing a downside here."
// STM_PLOT_LEADER_JP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3553733205" "If all else fails we could just blow stuff up.  I'm okay with that."

// STM_PLOT_LEADER_JP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3874775192" "I have a weakness for pain...of others.  Like yours, for instance."
// STM_PLOT_LEADER_JP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P381022652" "See?  Chaos has already begun!  Let's run with it!"
// STM_PLOT_LEADER_JP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3925895334" "I'm going to crush you like a bug!"

// STM_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P728246826" "Of course it's hot.  Like I went to a warehouse to buy in bulk."
// STM_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2579825468" "Look, makes no difference to me if you don't want it since I pinched it, but standing here waffling is a waste of my time.  And THAT IS money."
// STM_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4025840958" "Yeah, it's stolen.  Don't try and register it or you'll get a nice big surprise."
// STM_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2251002303" "You're kidding me, right?  Of course it's hot."
// STM_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2191524131" "I almost got caught.  What a rush!  I'll give you a discount."

// STM_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P760593136" "You shouldn't be here!"
// STM_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3044024845" "Get lost!"
// STM_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4175433846" "Beat it!"

// STM_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P522574473" "Hmm..."
// STM_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P406296230" "Let me think a second."
// STM_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2849230937" "I see..."
// STM_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4254456538" "Hrm..."

// STM_STEALING_NIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1286276822" "Yeah. It hurts. Pain is a privilege. You gotta embrace it."
// STM_STEALING_NIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3721933477" "Tonight's a great night for some carnage!"
// STM_STEALING_NIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1126098186" "Your night just went downhill!"


// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P303775077" "We need more parts!"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2694272857" "A door here, a fender there..."
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P996698820" "Got that engine block for my car yet?"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2612756475" "I have no idea what this piece does.  Swipe it anyway."
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P332686325" "How much can you carry?"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1580529861" "I think I can use this at my place.  I see art here."

// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3869222522" "This lot's ours!"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1617025200" "Think we can get some parts of this one?"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_LOOTING_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3874858321" "Get out of here!"

// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_OBSERVING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2268051900" "We need more fenders for our tanks!"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_OBSERVING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3687562547" "Hurry it up, we gotta get back!"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_OBSERVING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3939861428" "That car's still in good condition. Leave it alone!"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_OBSERVING_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3599636747" "What about that piece over there?"

// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_OBSERVING_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2728177808" "My boys will take care of you."
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_OBSERVING_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1387550735" "There ain't enough room here for all of us. I'll just squish you."
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_OBSERVING_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P788222392" "Oh you're in trouble now!"

// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_STANDINGWATCH_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1590688683" "I got my eye on everything.  You don't have to worry about me.  I'm on it.  What am I looking for again?"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_STANDINGWATCH_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1252835637" "I got this place covered.  Nothing is going to get past me.  You can count on me."
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_STANDINGWATCH_CARLOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P933725213" "What was I supposed to be doing again?  Right!  I'm on it!"

// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_STANDINGWATCH_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1445866848" "Ah, they're here!"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_STANDINGWATCH_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3145437123" "Okay that thing I was supposed to tell you when it happened?  It's happening!"
// STMARTIAL_FREAKSHOW_STANDINGWATCH_CARLOT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4234298538" "Hold it!  I remember now!  You there!  You're dead!"


